01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:07.780
One among you must be called upon to prove his loyalty.

01:05:09.140 --> 01:05:11.430
To erase all doubt.

01:05:15.840 --> 01:05:16.620
Bring in the subject.

01:06:05.020 --> 01:06:06.800
This young girl is to be the sacrifice.

01:06:08.090 --> 01:06:09.850
You stare at her without recognition.

01:06:10.930 --> 01:06:13.070
But there is one here who knows her.

01:06:15.220 --> 01:06:16.740
She was a part of his past.

01:06:18.550 --> 01:06:21.710
A past he should have deserted when he declared himself to Gamba.

01:06:26.580 --> 01:06:27.760
I did, I swear it.

01:06:28.780 --> 01:06:29.980
Why then did you enter these...

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:34.780
premises one night under the veil of darkness. Why then did you remove the pin from the doll

01:06:34.780 --> 01:06:44.970
thereby administering a cure? I have not been disloyal. Janke, tell him. You've got to believe

01:06:44.970 --> 01:06:54.840
me. Oh, great damper. He asks for your trust. This unworthy servant begs to be believed. It is for

01:06:54.840 --> 01:06:55.980
you to say.

01:07:02.620 --> 01:07:03.240
Step forward.

01:07:03.380 --> 01:07:09.360
Move yourself.

01:07:10.360 --> 01:07:12.840
It shall be your hand that turns the wheel.

01:07:14.730 --> 01:07:15.190
My hand?

01:07:19.950 --> 01:07:21.410
And I am to blame if the sword...

01:07:21.410 --> 01:07:21.610
Blame?

01:07:21.710 --> 01:07:23.590
This is not a question of blame.

01:07:23.590 --> 01:07:25.410
This is a question of loyalty.

01:07:26.530 --> 01:07:27.170
Pin the wheel.

01:07:29.360 --> 01:07:29.820
Why, Herr?

01:07:30.700 --> 01:07:31.700
Test me if you must.

01:07:31.980 --> 01:07:34.100
That is precisely what we are doing.

01:07:34.920 --> 01:07:36.700
Have you forgotten your oath of allegiance?

01:07:37.260 --> 01:07:39.400
You swore to follow the commands without question,

01:07:39.830 --> 01:07:41.170
though it meant someone's destruction,

01:07:41.470 --> 01:07:42.990
perhaps even your own.

01:07:44.460 --> 01:07:45.340
Bend the wheel.

01:08:59.020 --> 01:08:59.920
There's no choice here.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:01.000
That knife is set to kill!

01:09:02.170 --> 01:09:02.490
Murderers!

01:09:02.830 --> 01:09:03.410
All of you!

01:10:21.470 --> 01:10:23.070
The important thing is that you're safe and free of it.

01:10:24.460 --> 01:10:25.260
Are you free of it?

01:10:29.530 --> 01:10:29.970
Yes, sir.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:30.800
We both are
